tree Note card [note: pop]

box ledger as Ledger [note: Joins the leaf hashes two at a time and keeps only the last root hash, example: Kept root 7a21]

step Join
  say A box with note gets an i mark at its top right. Click it and a card with the whole note and an example band opens just below.
  leaf tx1 [hash: 3fa0]
  leaf tx2 [hash: 8b04]
  node root of tx1, tx2 [hash: 7a21]
